WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.135 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, I hope this
stereotype is true --

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:03.570 align:start size:94% position:6%
or it seems to me
that it's true --

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
that Australians travel
like nobody else.

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:07.207
-Well, it's so far from
everywhere else that when

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:10.343
you leave, you may as well
just keep going for a long time.

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:12.645 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Yeah. Yes, it's true.

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:14.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, when you meet
an Australian on vacation,

00:00:14.381 --> 00:00:16.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
you realize they're like
six months into it

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:17.584 line:92%
and they have six months to go

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:18.184 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes.

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:19.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's how it's
always been for me.

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:23.023
But you -- So, you traveled
lot when you were younger.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:26.726 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, now, explain to me that -
You would shave your head?

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:31.164
Is this a thing that is true
-I've shaved my head five times.

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:33.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And what brought you to
shave your head?

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.535 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I find it very cleansing.
-Yeah.

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:38.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. I mean,
the first time I did it,

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:39.606 size:88% position:44% line:92%
it was my 25th birthday.

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:40.407 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I was in Mexico.

00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:42.442 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had too much tequila and
I trusted this guy.

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:45.645 align:start size:94% position:6%
Kind of plump hands.
I thought, "He's doing it.

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:47.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
The next time I did it was
for a friend's --

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:50.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
Actually, I been in
Nepal and India with her,

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:53.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
and her fashion show
was inspired by

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:54.120 line:92%
the hill tribes of Nepal.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.756
So, she asked me to be in it
and I shaved my head then.

00:00:56.756 --> 00:01:00.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then I met my husband,
and three days into what was -

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:02.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
What we now know is
a relationship,

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:03.997 align:start size:94% position:6%
I shaved my head to test him
to see if he

00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:05.698 align:start size:94% position:6%
still liked me
when I look like that.

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:10.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wait.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
Wait. Three...
-Days.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:13.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Three days?
-Yeah.

00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:15.875 size:75% position:38%
-Why did you want to
test him so quickly?

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I could have
done it on day two.

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:20.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that's true.
You gave him a grace period.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:21.581 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-So, that's three.

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:22.449 line:92%
Do you remember the other ones

00:01:22.449 --> 00:01:25.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did one in
a Peter Greenaway film.

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:26.219 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:27.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then, more recently -
I think it was about

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.589
five years ago now -- I made a
film called "Miss You Already"

00:01:29.589 --> 00:01:30.890 size:75% position:38% line:92%
with Drew Barrymore.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:31.324 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:34.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And it was shaved for
my character, who had cancer

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:37.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And, so, now do you think tha
you -- Is that it?

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:38.765 line:92%
Do you think you're done now

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:40.967
-Well, my hair, a few weeks ago,
was this long.

00:01:40.967 --> 00:01:41.534 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay, gotcha.

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:43.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I could be bald right now
but I decided

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:46.573 line:92%
I should only go to here.

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:47.540 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-There's one last thing.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.042
I believe you've seen it,
but I do want to show it.

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:51.811
Our friend John Early --
he's a wonderful comedian.

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:55.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he was a guest on
this show, and one thing

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
he really wanted to do
on this show

00:01:56.416 --> 00:01:58.485 align:start size:94% position:6%
was his Toni Collette
impression.

00:01:58.485 --> 00:01:59.819 line:92%
He felt it was very strong

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:03.423
And he does an impression of you
in "The Sixth Sense."

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:06.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I played --
In the clip, I took over -

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:09.162 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Were you Haley?
-I was Haley Joel Osment.

00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:09.929 line:92%
And he was Toni Collette.

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:11.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
And if you would just like t
look over there,

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:15.902 align:start size:94% position:6%
we would love to show you
John Early's impression of you

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:18.805 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-What did ask her?

00:02:22.175 --> 00:02:23.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Voice breaking ]
I asked her....

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:27.881 line:92%
-Oh, my God. What is that?

00:02:27.881 --> 00:02:33.019 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-...do I make her proud?

00:02:33.019 --> 00:02:35.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He's hilarious.
-He is hilarious.

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:37.924 align:start size:94% position:6%
Next time, you can do an
impression of him.

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:39.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
We will make sure
we give you time.

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:40.293 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Thank you so much.

00:02:40.293 --> 00:02:42.695 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is Toni Collette,
everybody.

